# Reverb Real-time

## Client

`src/shared/services/echo.ts` — singleton Echo instance with `broadcaster: 'reverb'`.

Env vars: `VITE_REVERB_APP_KEY`, `VITE_REVERB_HOST`, `VITE_REVERB_PORT`, `VITE_REVERB_SCHEME`.

## Auth

Private channels authenticate via `POST /broadcasting/auth` with Sanctum Bearer token.

## Subscribe pattern

```ts
const echo = getEcho()
echo.private(`App.Models.User.${userId}`).notification((payload) => {
  // update ['notifications'] query cache
})
```

## Cleanup

Call `disconnectEcho()` on logout. Unsubscribe in `useEffect` cleanup.

## Laravel backend requirements

- `BROADCAST_CONNECTION=reverb`
- Notifications implement `ShouldBroadcast` / `toBroadcast`
- Channel auth in `routes/channels.php` for `App.Models.User.{id}`
